<title>POLAND: Polish shares close lower in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares close lower in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thirteen stocks fell, five rose and three were flat in 13-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Thursday.</p>
<p>NFI units fell 2.9 percent to 153 zlotys in a 26-million-zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
